hamcall-db — reflector directory: LICENSE (CC BY 4.0, scoped)
==============================================================

WHAT THIS FILE COVERS
---------------------
The SEPARATE digital-voice reflector directory artifacts:

  * hamcall-db-reflectors-YYYY-MM-DD.parquet
  * hamcall-db-reflectors-dmr-talkgroups-YYYY-MM-DD.parquet
  * hamcall-db-reflectors-YYYY-MM-DD.db   (tables: reflectors, dmr_talkgroups)
  * the static JSON API published at site/api/v1/ (index.json, reflectors.json,
    reflectors/*.json, the per-network DMR talkgroup files at
    reflectors/dmr/<network>/talkgroups.json, and openapi.json)

These files list digital-voice reflectors (D-Star, M17, YSF, NXDN, P25, URF and
DMR master servers) with their addresses, ports and modules, plus DMR talkgroup
lists. They are NOT under the CC BY-NC 4.0 terms that cover the rest of the
hamcall-db project.

